@format 1
@id export.apply-preset
@title Apply export preset
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Replace the tab-specific export state with the selected preset and refresh its summary.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge
@flow TB
@related export.add-preset, export.restore-modifications

@alias export = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PExport

[input] Preset selected for application <input>
- Receive the selected preset's Apply command @ export.PExportPresetApply(...)
> apply

[apply] Apply preset state <process>
- Copy the selected preset into the tab-specific export state @ export.PExportPresetApply(...)
- Refresh the export summary and modified-state surface @ export.PExportSummaryUpdate(...)
> result

[result] Preset applied <output>
= New work descriptions use the selected preset's output state.
